---
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro';
---

<StarlightPage
  hasSidebar={false}
  frontmatter={{
    title: 'Creator Programme',
    description: 'How VISCERIUM credits, supports, and works with creative contributors.',
    tableOfContents: false,
    giscus: false,
  }}
>
  <div class="creator-programme-page">
    <section class="creator-hero" aria-labelledby="creator-hero-title">
      <span class="creator-hero__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="creator-shell creator-hero__inner">
        <div>
          <p class="creator-kicker">VISCERIUM Creator Programme</p>
          <h1 id="creator-hero-title">Build something. Keep your name on it.</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="creator-hero__copy">
          <p class="creator-hero__lead">VISCERIUM is built as a coherent universe without making its creators invisible.</p>
          <p>People who materially contribute to the world should be credited for their work and, where agreed, paid for it.</p>
          <a class="creator-jump" href="#principles">How it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="creator-section" id="principles" aria-labelledby="creator-principles-title">
      <div class="creator-shell">
        <div class="creator-section__header">
          <div>
            <p class="creator-index">01 / Principles</p>
            <h2 id="creator-principles-title">A few rules. Kept simple.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>VISCERIUM keeps central ownership and editorial control. Creative contributors keep clear credit and work under agreed terms.</p>
        </div>

        <ol class="creator-principles">
          <li>
            <p class="creator-index">01</p>
            <h3>Credit the maker.</h3>
            <p>Accepted creative work names the people responsible for it.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p class="creator-index">02</p>
            <h3>Agree before use.</h3>
            <p>Creative rights and usage terms are agreed before material is accepted.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p class="creator-index">03</p>
            <h3>Pay where agreed.</h3>
            <p>Substantial work may be commissioned, paid directly, or covered by another written agreement.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p class="creator-index">04</p>
            <h3>Canon stays curated.</h3>
            <p>Contribution does not make material canon automatically. VISCERIUM retains editorial control.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="creator-section creator-section--participation" id="participation" aria-labelledby="creator-participation-title">
      <div class="creator-shell">
        <div class="creator-section__header">
          <div>
            <p class="creator-index">02 / Participation</p>
            <h2 id="creator-participation-title">Different work needs different terms.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>The agreement should match the contribution. Small community input is not treated like commissioned art, writing, or sustained authorship.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="creator-tiers">
          <article class="creator-tier">
            <div>
              <p class="creator-tier__label">01 / Community</p>
              <h3>Suggestions and fixes</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Discussion, corrections, technical fixes, and feedback.</p>
            <p>Usually unpaid. Credit or thanks where appropriate.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="creator-tier">
            <div>
              <p class="creator-tier__label">02 / Contributor</p>
              <h3>Accepted creative work</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Lore, writing, artwork, maps, research, design, or similar work.</p>
            <p>Named credit and compensation where agreed.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="creator-tier">
            <div>
              <p class="creator-tier__label">03 / Partner</p>
              <h3>Sustained authorship</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Commissioned work or substantial ongoing collaboration.</p>
            <p>Individually negotiated terms.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="creator-fund" id="fund" aria-labelledby="creator-fund-title">
      <div class="creator-shell creator-fund__inner">
        <div>
          <p class="creator-index">03 / Creator Fund</p>
          <h2 id="creator-fund-title">Support beyond a single commission.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="creator-fund__copy">
          <p>The Creator Fund is intended to give eligible creators another way to participate financially as the programme develops.</p>
          <p class="creator-note">The final structure and eligibility rules will be published when the scheme is ready.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="creator-support-log" aria-labelledby="creator-support-log-title">
          <div class="creator-support-log__header">
            <div>
              <p class="creator-index">Public record</p>
              <h3 id="creator-support-log-title">Creator support to date</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Aggregate figures only. Individual compensation and contract terms remain private unless a creator chooses otherwise.</p>
          </div>

          <dl class="creator-support-metrics">
            <div class="creator-support-metric">
              <dt>Paid directly to artists and creators</dt>
              <dd class="creator-support-metric__status">Not published</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="creator-support-metric">
              <dt>Unique creators financially supported</dt>
              <dd class="creator-support-metric__status">Not published</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="creator-support-metric">
              <dt>NULL / VISCERIUM Creator Fund</dt>
              <dd class="creator-support-metric__status">Launching</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="creator-support-metric">
              <dt>Creator Fund distributions to date</dt>
              <dd class="creator-support-metric__status">Pending</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
          <p class="creator-support-log__note">Historic direct commissions are reported separately from distributions made through the formal Creator Fund.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</StarlightPage>

<style is:global>
  .creator-programme-page {
    --creator-bg: var(--sl-color-bg);
    --creator-surface: var(--codex-surface-raised-color);
    --creator-text: var(--sl-color-white);
    --creator-body: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    --creator-muted: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    --creator-accent: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    --creator-void: var(--home-void);
    --creator-fixed-text: var(--home-text-fixed);
    --creator-fixed-body: var(--home-text-soft-fixed);
    --creator-wide: 118rem;
    --creator-gutter: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 5.5rem);
    --creator-line: color-mix(in oklch, var(--codex-palette-deep) 72%, transparent);
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    overflow: clip;
    background: var(--creator-bg);
    color: var(--creator-body);
    font-family: var(--vc-font-body);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, .96rem + .15vw, 1.1rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .creator-programme-page *,
  .creator-programme-page *::before,
  .creator-programme-page *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .creator-programme-page :where(h1, h2, h3, p) {
    margin-block-start: 0;
  }

  .creator-programme-page :where(h1, h2, h3) {
    color: var(--creator-text);
    font-family: var(--vc-font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-synthesis-weight: none;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .creator-programme-page p {
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .creator-shell {
    width: min(100%, var(--creator-wide));
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: var(--creator-gutter);
  }

  .creator-kicker,
  .creator-index,
  .creator-tier__label {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-muted);
    font-family: var(--vc-font-ui);
    font-size: .68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .creator-hero {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    min-block-size: min(72rem, calc(100svh - var(--sl-nav-height, 3.5rem)));
    align-items: end;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 78% 18%,
        color-mix(in oklch, var(--codex-palette-deep) 48%, transparent),
        transparent 30rem
      ),
      var(--creator-void);
    color: var(--creator-fixed-body);
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .creator-hero__mark {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: clamp(-12rem, -4vw, -2rem);
    z-index: -1;
    width: clamp(28rem, 62vw, 68rem);
    aspect-ratio: 1756 / 969;
    translate: 0 -50%;
    background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--creator-fixed-text) 8.5%, transparent);
    -webkit-mask: url('/assets/brand/viscerium-logo.svg') center / contain no-repeat;
    mask: url('/assets/brand/viscerium-logo.svg') center / contain no-repeat;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .creator-hero__inner {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(20rem, .65fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 9rem);
    align-items: end;
    padding-top: clamp(7rem, 12vw, 12rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 7.5rem);
  }

  .creator-kicker {
    margin-bottom: .9rem;
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text);
    letter-spacing: .2em;
  }

  .creator-hero h1 {
    max-width: 10ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text);
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 3rem + 7vw, 10rem);
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    line-height: .84;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .creator-hero__copy {
    align-self: end;
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    padding-bottom: .55rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--codex-palette-deep);
  }

  .creator-hero__lead {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1.05rem + .7vw, 1.75rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .creator-hero__copy > p:not(.creator-hero__lead) {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: .85rem 0 0;
    color: var(--creator-fixed-body);
    font-size: .98rem;
  }

  .creator-jump {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .55rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: .72rem .9rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--creator-fixed-text);
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text) !important;
    font-family: var(--vc-font-ui);
    font-size: .68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    line-height: 1;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .creator-jump:hover,
  .creator-jump:focus-visible {
    background: var(--creator-fixed-text);
    color: var(--creator-void) !important;
    outline: none;
  }

  .creator-jump:focus-visible {
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--creator-void), 0 0 0 4px var(--creator-fixed-text);
  }

  .creator-section {
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-section--participation {
    background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--creator-surface) 65%, var(--creator-bg));
  }

  .creator-section__header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(14rem, .75fr) minmax(22rem, 1.25fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 7rem);
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .creator-section__header h2,
  .creator-fund h2 {
    margin: .8rem 0 0;
    color: var(--creator-text);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 1.9rem + 2.5vw, 5.4rem);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: .98;
    text-transform: none;
  }

  .creator-section__header h2 {
    max-width: 16ch;
  }

  .creator-section__header > p {
    max-width: 43rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-body);
  }

  .creator-principles {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .creator-principles > li {
    min-height: 15rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-principles > li::marker {
    content: none;
  }

  .creator-principles h3,
  .creator-tier h3,
  .creator-support-log h3 {
    margin: .9rem 0 .75rem;
    color: var(--creator-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 1.1rem + .8vw, 2.1rem);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: 1.05;
    text-transform: none;
  }

  .creator-principles p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-body);
    font-size: .95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .creator-tiers {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-tier {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, .7fr) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    padding: 1.6rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-tier h3 {
    margin-top: .55rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .creator-tier > p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-body);
    font-size: .96rem;
  }

  .creator-fund {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
    background: var(--creator-void);
    color: var(--creator-fixed-body);
  }

  .creator-fund__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(24rem, 1.2fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 7rem);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .creator-fund .creator-index {
    color: var(--codex-palette-mid);
  }

  .creator-fund h2 {
    max-width: 13ch;
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text);
  }

  .creator-fund__copy {
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  .creator-fund__copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-fixed-body);
  }

  .creator-fund__copy p + p {
    margin-top: .8rem;
  }

  .creator-fund__copy .creator-note {
    color: var(--codex-palette-mid);
    font-size: .88rem;
  }

  .creator-support-log {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin-top: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem);
    padding-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-support-log__header {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .creator-support-log h3 {
    margin-top: .55rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.25rem + 1vw, 2.4rem);
  }

  .creator-support-log__header > p {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--codex-palette-mid);
    font-size: .9rem;
  }

  .creator-support-metrics {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-support-metric {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 8.5rem;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.1rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-support-metric dt,
  .creator-support-metric dd {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .creator-support-metric dt {
    max-width: 16rem;
    color: var(--codex-palette-mid);
    font-family: var(--vc-font-ui);
    font-size: .68rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .creator-support-metric dd {
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text);
    font-family: var(--vc-font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 1.1rem + .8vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .creator-support-metric__status {
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text);
  }

  .creator-support-log__note {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--codex-palette-mid);
    font-size: .84rem;
  }

  body:has(.creator-programme-page) .sl-markdown-content :is(
    .creator-hero h1,
    .creator-section__header h2,
    .creator-principles h3,
    .creator-tier h3,
    .creator-fund h2,
    .creator-support-log h3
  ) {
    display: block;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: var(--vc-font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-synthesis-weight: none;
  }

  body:has(.creator-programme-page) .sl-markdown-content :is(
    .creator-hero h1,
    .creator-section__header h2,
    .creator-principles h3,
    .creator-tier h3,
    .creator-fund h2,
    .creator-support-log h3
  )::before,
  body:has(.creator-programme-page) .sl-markdown-content :is(
    .creator-hero h1,
    .creator-section__header h2,
    .creator-principles h3,
    .creator-tier h3,
    .creator-fund h2,
    .creator-support-log h3
  )::after {
    content: none;
    display: none;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) {
    padding-top: 0 !important;
    padding-inline: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) div.content-panel:nth-child(1) {
    display: none !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) > .codex-two-column-content,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) > .codex-two-column-content > .codex-main-pane,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) > .codex-two-column-content > .codex-main-pane > main,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) main > .content-panel,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) main > .content-panel > .sl-container,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .sl-markdown-content,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .creator-programme-page {
    inline-size: 100% !important;
    max-inline-size: none !important;
    margin-inline: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) > .codex-two-column-content > .codex-main-pane {
    display: grid !important;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) !important;
    column-gap: 0 !important;
    row-gap: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) > .codex-two-column-content > .codex-main-pane > main {
    grid-column: 1 / -1 !important;
    grid-row: 1 !important;
    min-inline-size: 0;
    padding: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) main > .content-panel {
    padding: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) main > .content-panel > .sl-container,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .sl-markdown-content {
    padding-inline: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .sl-markdown-content {
    margin-block-start: 0 !important;
    padding-block: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .content-panel > .sl-container > .codex-header-fade-filter,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .content-panel > .sl-container > .codex-header-figure,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .content-panel > .sl-container > h1#_top,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .content-panel > .sl-container > .codex-breadcrumbs,
  body:has(.creator-programme-page) .codex-contributors {
    display: none !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 72rem) {
    .creator-principles,
    .creator-support-metrics {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 54rem) {
    .creator-hero {
      min-block-size: auto;
    }

    .creator-hero__inner,
    .creator-section__header,
    .creator-fund__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .creator-hero__inner {
      padding-top: 7rem;
      padding-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .creator-hero__mark {
      right: -14rem;
      width: 42rem;
      opacity: .75;
    }

    .creator-section__header > p {
      align-self: start;
    }

    .creator-tier {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: .65rem;
    }

    .creator-support-log__header {
      display: grid;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 38rem) {
    .creator-principles,
    .creator-support-metrics {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .creator-principles > li {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .creator-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 18vw, 6rem);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .creator-jump {
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  @media (forced-colors: active) {
    .creator-hero__mark {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
